        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[clamp(24px,3.5vw,32px)] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mb-2">Frequently asked questions</h2>

        <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
          <div class="faq-q flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-5 cursor-pointer">
            <span class="font-display font-semibold text-[16px] text-ink">How much should I budget for UGC content?</span>
