          <div class="faq-a overflow-hidden max-h-0 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="pb-5 text-[15px] text-ink-2 leading-[1.65]">For a meaningful creative testing program, plan for $2,000&ndash;$5,000 per month, which covers 10&ndash;25 videos depending on complexity and creator tier. Brands scaling beyond testing typically invest $5,000&ndash;$15,000 per month for 25&ndash;60+ videos across multiple creators and formats.</div>
