        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65]">This guide is based on pricing data from OKAD's managed creator network of 700+ active UGC creators, supplemented by marketplace rate analysis and direct brand feedback across multiple verticals. All rates are directional benchmarks as of September 2026 and will vary based on creator location, brand requirements, and market conditions. OKAD updates this reference quarterly. See also: <a href="/ugc-creator" class="text-accent hover:underline">UGC Creator Guide</a>, <a href="/ugc-ads" class="text-accent hover:underline">UGC Ads</a>, <a href="/high-volume-ugc" class="text-accent hover:underline">High-Volume UGC</a>, <a href="/creator-network" class="text-accent hover:underline">Creator Network</a>, <a href="/canvas-ugc" class="text-accent hover:underline">Canvas UGC</a>.</p>
